{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/sdk/package.test.ts","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T19:06:45.502042Z","id":"a3bef21f835c3f2d037b0bdf531fc7da94bafdbe3cf19f8ae063bdba45d54e40","body":{"detail":"beforeAll copies web/dist-sdk into the test app's node_modules (cpSync). npm publishes what `npm pack` selects, which honours `files`, .npmignore and npm's always-excluded names. With no `files` field the two agree today; once the package gains a `files` list or a README or an .npmignore, the test would still pass on files npm leaves out.","kind":"suggestion","span":{"start":{"line":39},"end":{"line":47},"content_hash":"ae66846a8da10415c264042b514383a88cc1183350c242f1b5cc7e9d8becb7d5"},"suggested_fix":"Run `npm pack --pack-destination <tmp>` (or `pnpm pack`) on web/dist-sdk and install the tarball into the test app (e.g. extract it into node_modules/@empathic/clax-sdk).","summary":"The package test installs web/dist-sdk by copying the directory, not by `npm pack`, so it does not check what npm would publish","tags":["review","review:pr35-sdk-package","npm","session:claude-code:8e745615-4eb7-451a-a3d4-35f6e2615e17"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"web/sdk/package.test.ts","issuer":"mailto:benbarber121@gmail.com","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-29T19:11:00.341172Z","id":"cd05196f1679a274b4c39a388250289f8941137e10c17f3051f90855223085b2","body":{"detail":"web/sdk/package.test.ts:38-47 (beforeAll starts at 38, not 39) runs cpSync(pkgDir, installed, {recursive: true}) at :45. https://docs.npmjs.com/cli/v10/commands/npm-publish: with a `files` field 'only the files specified will be included', .npmignore excludes files, and `npm pack` 'figures out the files to be included'. web/scripts/build-sdk.mjs:55-71 sets no `files` and writes no .npmignore, so the copy and the tarball agree today. Kind (suggestion) fits.","kind":"comment","references":"a3bef21f835c3f2d037b0bdf531fc7da94bafdbe3cf19f8ae063bdba45d54e40","summary":"confirmed: the test installs by cpSync of web/dist-sdk, not from an npm pack tarball","tags":["verified:confirmed","session:claude-code:8e745615-4eb7-451a-a3d4-35f6e2615e17"]}}
